# crew-server — a machine that runs crew as its one service (heavy-duty/crew#822).
# HOST="yes": rig's delegation installs box and runs its host setup, which
# `crew service setup` needs for `box grant --service crew`. ROOT_DOOR and JOIN
# match gig-server: a fleet machine with automation on its root door, joined by
# pre-auth key (#46).
ROOT_DOOR="open"
HOST="yes"
JOIN="authkey"
